Alkinum maintains Removent. Send a request using the form below. A Removent account is not required.

<SupportForm locale="en" />

## Before sending

- For native connections, enable the host on your Mac and grant its required screen/input permissions. Use the same LAN for your first connection.
- Check the protocol, address, port, and computer's authentication policy. A relay access password does not replace the computer's authentication.
- Keep the mobile app in the foreground during a session. After returning from the background, use Reconnect if prompted.
- See [connecting](/docs/connecting), [permissions](/docs/permissions), [VNC](/docs/vnc), [RDP](/docs/rdp), and [relay setup](/docs/relay).

## Privacy requests

Explain what you want to access, correct, or delete without including passwords or private screen contents. Local connections are managed in the app. See our [privacy policy](/privacy) for optional iCloud and support data.
